            LiteSpeedEngine["LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server (Port 80 / 443)<br/>• .htaccess URL Rewrite Engine (Forced HTTPS)<br/>• SSL/TLS Termination (Sectigo / Let's Encrypt)<br/>• Direct Static File Serving (Gzip / Brotli)"]
